        "title_style": "display-md",
        "font_size": 40,
        "font_size_mobile": 20,
        "body": "<p>In 2014, two friends, Matt and Ben, <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gold\">pitched a bold idea</a> at a student \"Shark Tank\" competition: <strong>bring the taste and freshness of New York coffee shop cold brew into everyone's fridge.</strong></p><p>They won $7,000, invented the cold brew box (once called the <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gold\">single greatest invention of mankind ever</a>), and started brewing in a small Queens facility. We were among the first brands in what became an entirely new category.</p><p><strong>Nearly 100,000,000 cups later, our mission hasn't changed:</strong></p><p class=\"text-gold\"><strong>Take inspiration from coffee shop culture to craft cold brew coffee good enough to drink every day.</strong></p>",
